menuconfig MODULES_FLIP_RIG
	bool "flip_rig"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for flip_rig

		Standalone, manually-started single-shot 360 degree flip
		controller for a fixture that physically prevents translation
		(e.g. a 3-axis gimbal/gyroscope test rig). Never touches position/
		GPS - start with `flip_rig start` and do not run it alongside
		another OFFBOARD-publishing module. The instant OFFBOARD is
		engaged, it latches the vehicle's current yaw, executes exactly
		one 360 degree roll via raw body-rate setpoints, then commands a
		level attitude at the latched yaw and holds it.
